    <statement><p>Write an equation of the plane with normal vector <m>\bf{n}</m><m>=\left\lt -4,-9,-9\right&gt;</m> passing through the point <m>\left( -1, 9, 9 \right)</m> in scalar form</p>
<p><fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0001"/><m>= -474</m></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>-\left(12x+27y+27z\right)</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <solution><m>\left\lt  -4, -9, -9 \right&gt; \cdot \left\lt  x, y, z \right&gt; = \left\lt  -4, -9, -9 \right&gt; \cdot \left\lt  -1, 9, 9 \right&gt; = 4 - 81 - 81=-158</m>



To obtain the scalar form we compute the dot product above



<m>-\left(4x+9y+9z\right)=-158</m>



or in the form 



<m>-\left(12x+27y+27z\right)=-474</m>


</solution>
